# Default: auto-detect text vs binary; normalize EOL on commit (stored as LF in index,
# checked out per platform default — .editorconfig enforces CRLF in editors).
# This matches the repo's existing core.autocrlf=true history (index is LF,
# working tree is CRLF on Windows) and avoids a full-repo EOL churn.
* text=auto

# Binary files — never normalize
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
